# Pairs with RuleAuthoringConfined: the policy store admits a tenant: rule written directly off system origin.

MODULE: OperatorWritesTenantRule
TARGET: RuleAuthoringConfined
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the policy store admits a tenant: rule written directly off system origin
PERTURBS: OperatorUpsert

--- FIND
    /\ r.layer = "operator"
    /\ rules' = rules \cup {r}
    /\ last' = [Blank EXCEPT !.kind = "write", !.actor = "operator", !.rule = r]
--- REPLACE
    /\ rules' = rules \cup {r}
    /\ last' = [Blank EXCEPT !.kind = "write", !.actor = "operator", !.rule = r]
--- END
